      <span class="text-mesh-accent">│</span>
      <span class="text-mesh-accent">├────</span> <span class="text-cyan-400">STUN + reliable encrypted UDP</span> ──── <span class="text-cyan-400">remote peers</span>
      <span class="text-mesh-accent">│</span>
      <span class="text-mesh-accent">└────</span> <span class="text-yellow-400">MeshTalk Relay (fallback)</span> ──── <span class="text-yellow-400">remote peers</span></code></pre>
